WEBVTT

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:52.780
in the last episode of Dragon Ball Z.

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:56.970
The wicked Cell Juniors drove our heroes straight into the dirt.

00:01:57.290 --> 00:01:59.670
Enduring hit after brutal hit.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.260
The powerful Z-Fighters were beaten and broken,

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:04.780
left to die in the lonely desert ring.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.920
Not even Piccolo or the Super Saiyans

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.740
could turn back the dreadful attackers.

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:12.270
We'll be right back.

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:13.370
Thank you.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:15.550
With a painful gasp of realization,

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:18.790
Goku began to think he'd been wrong about his son.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.880
And through all the horror.

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:28.880
Gohan watched.

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:29.790
Thank you.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:35.140
Now take your anger and feed off of it before it's too late for your friends.

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:43.180
Meanwhile, Mr. Satan showed a sliver of courage as he answered the bodiless Sixteen's plea and threw him into the battle.

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:48.010
for the exploded android had one last message for the young boy.

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:51.560
Let it go.

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:59.830
I do know how you feel, Gohan, but it is not a sin to fight for the right cause.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.740
there are those who words alone will not reach.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:09.960
Let it go.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:14.840
And then, with a swift and fatal step.

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:18.190
16's head was crushed before Gohan's eyes.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.340
and the light of the gentle android.

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:23.380
Faded.

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:24.940
Thank you.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:34.640
Yet another fighter you could have saved.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:39.570
Before his death, 16 asked Gohan to protect all the life he loved,

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:42.340
