00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.480
And now he will.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:48.330
If there was a button to press, Cell has pressed it.

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:51.910
If there was a final wall, Cell has torn it down.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:54.910
For the gentleness in Gohan has flown away.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.810
And the power has awoken.

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:07.000
today on Dragon Ball Z.

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:38.150
